               {'time': '1130', 'title': '75 minutes into the unit (about 125 mL infused)', 'lines': ['She says "I can\'t breathe," is coughing, restless and pulling at the wound vac tubing and trying to climb over the bed rail. New crackles at both lung bases. The daughter is at the bedside.']},
